OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AOur brother did not match description
OL,4,Aof 'Putney pusher', suspect's sisters
OL,5,Atell BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrandram was found dead on Tuesday
OL,8,Fevening and his family said he "took
OL,9,Fhis own life after months of immense
OL,10,Fpressure" caused by the Met
OL,11,Finvestigation.
OL,13,FThe Met said it recognised the "strain
OL,14,Fthat being subject to a police
OL,15,Finvestigation" could cause, and that a
OL,16,Fmandatory referral had been made to the
OL,17,Fpolice watchdog.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
